  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組需要 Refined Storage</span></a></span></strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">如果您希望將此模組加入您的模組包，歡迎自由使用 :)<br>此模組提供了來自 Refined Storage 與 RSRequestify 的更優化版 Exporter、Importer、Constructor、Destructor、Disk Interface、Autocrafter、Interface 與 Requester。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">1.20.1 或以下版本：<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">Elite：額外 9 個過濾槽位，速度提升 2 倍<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">Ultra：額外 27 個過濾槽位，速度提升 5 倍，內建堆疊升級<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">Mega：額外 45 個過濾槽位，速度提升 6.5 倍，內建堆疊升級<br><br>1.21.1 或以上版本：<br>Elite：額外 9 個過濾槽位，速度提升 2 倍<br>Ultra：額外 27 個過濾槽位，速度提升 5 倍，內建堆疊升級<br>Mega：額外 45 個過濾槽位，速度提升 8 倍，內建堆疊升級<br></span>創造（Creative）：額外 45 個過濾槽位，速度提升 15000 倍，內建堆疊升級</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特殊功能：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>標籤過濾</li>\n<li>自動合成指定側面輸入</li>\n<li>自動合成器匯入模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">匯入器配方：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/173/310/172/elite_importer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/168/310/172/ultra_importer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/164/310/172/creative_importer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>匯出器配方：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/171/310/172/elite_exporter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/167/310/172/ultra_exporter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/163/310/172/creative_exporter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>建構器配方：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/169/310/172/elite_constructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/165/310/172/ultra_constructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/160/310/172/creative_constructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>摧毀器配方：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/170/310/172/elite_destructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/166/310/172/ultra_destructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/161/310/172/creative_destructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>磁碟操控器配方：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/383/310/172/elite_disk_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/382/310/172/ultra_disk_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/381/310/172/creative_disk_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請求器配方：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/794/310/172/elite_requester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/795/310/172/ultra_requester.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/792/310/172/creative_requester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"144\"></a></p>",
